SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Kostos and Prodromos
LOCATION:Prodromos\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Both Kostos and Prodromos have a chapel of Agios Panteleimon and hold a village feast for the saint on the evening of 26 July\, with food and island music. The municipal tourism page lists this feast under two wrong dates (26 June and 26 August)\, so treat 26-27 July as the correct one and confirm locally. Prodromos is the easier of the two to reach and has the bigger square.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#prodromos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kostos-and-prodromos
